 (3797,3831,'INTENTION FORGETTING',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_INTENTION_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Three models54 component runs486 reexecution prefixes separate Open goal from inaccessible retained route and genuinely lost instruction. Reminder4 produces actual A/B5 from recalled content,not diagnostic input archive. Capacity1 loses old instruction; NoLoss retains it; PersistentAccess acts3 without reminder but cannot restore lost content. Existing top-K selects sole nonmatching instruction at zero score: wrong cue is not generally no recall. Preserve failed action-at5 expectation because no-neutral case already fulfilled3; accepted recall law unchanged. Cancellation/expiry terminal,opportunity absence and execution failure distinct. Auto single positive option uses no invented random draw. First behavior cohort insufficiently bound resolved inherited config; REV2 commits exact operands,rereuns all54 with unchanged final/safe/prefix hashes but changed identities. Preserve typing/interrupted test/zero-score/identity cohorts. Component reexecution is not public canonical save/scheduler rollback; no prospective-state reduction or general decay.'),
 (3832,3866,'TEMPORAL GOAL CONFLICT',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_TEMPORAL_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Four models27 component runs243 prefixes maintain two adopted desired states with independent reasons,deadlines,progress/access and retirement. Primary short2 then long3/4/5 yields1/3 units without cancelling loser. HorizonRelative versus NoTemporalBias differ first distributions but same primary acts; temporal weighting necessity not earned. DropLoser and SharedRetirement both fail primary but coincide because winning first act fulfills short goal,so result does not uniquely diagnose either collapse. Selective cancellation/expiry tests preserve sibling. Admitted fresh receipts change chosen progress only; hidden success can leave both expired,false success can falsely fulfill. Whole later safe views preserve denied/false outcome boundaries. Actual inherited reason/dice/expression/execute kernels used,not weighted roulette. Boolean access/availability and future opening do not guarantee completion capacity; no general currency/optimal scheduling/native source admission. Eight clauses separately bounded,not joint prospection closure.'),
